1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,520
Mission Architect.

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:04,680
Design a real space mission,
right in your browser.

3
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:07,890
Pick a goal: Earth, the Moon, or Mars.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:13,460
Build your spacecraft in 3D, and watch
every choice cost mass, power and budget.

5
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:18,170
Orbits come from NASA GMAT,
launch windows from JPL Horizons.

6
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:22,790
Then fly it: your spacecraft sends back
real NASA satellite images,

7
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,360
blurred if your pointing is weak.

8
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:25,850
Learn why it worked.

9
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,810
Redesign. Relaunch.
